      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "バーベルの塔・25階を制覇した主人公たちは、\n更に上へ上へと階段を上り、50階へと辿り着いた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f97a8be0babaff56760a1086b769939bead8194526cca939c69436d81c286c7b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "や、やっと……50階……まで、きました、よ……はぁはぁ……。\nもう、マッスルなんとか、というトレーニングロケーションは\n出てこないんじゃないですか……？",
      "jp_sha256": "63635abb3c3eee1f225ed8cd151127e6d406329a6ad9c0bcfda431257c472330",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "겨, 겨우…… 50층……까지 왔, 네요…… 하아하아…….\n이제 머슬 뭐시기라는 훈련 장소는\n더 안 나오는 거겠죠……?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "dcc35167df94f73ce841c2a6f57f3ea0160bf23af7f2ff57b20d72ff6c150b39:000002_6069970585139796050:g0:r12",
      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "や、やっと……50階……まで、きました、よ……はぁはぁ……。\nもう、マッスルなんとか、というトレーニングロケーションは\n出てこないんじゃないですか……？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
